<p><strong>How consultation works</strong></p>
<p>We will:</p>
<ul>
	<li>publish the application documents online</li>
	<li>carry out consultations with required organisations</li>
	<li>publish press notices if required</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>How to comment</strong></p>
<p>
	Anyone can submit a comment on a planning application.
	You must submit your comments before the consultation deadline.
	We may not consider comments received after this date.
</p>

